## Layout — section by section
### 0. Page structure
```
<main>
  <Header/>                              position: fixed, above everything
  <div class="scene">                    height: 400svh (the scroll scene)
    <div class="pin">                    position: sticky; top: 0; height: 100svh; overflow: hidden
      <div class="stage">                position: absolute; inset: 0; pointer-events: none
        PortraitCanvas  (canvas, inset 0, starts at opacity 0)
        wash            (div, inset 0, background bg, opacity 0)
        Hud             (a centred wrapper div with the scanner svg inside)
        LensStack       (centred, opacity 0)
      <div class="track">                position: absolute; top 0; left 0; right 0; slides up by one screen
        Hero            (section, height 100svh)
        Features        (section, height 100svh)
```
Nothing may set `overflow` on `html`, `body` or any ancestor of `.pin`, or sticky stops working. The page has no
other content: when the scene ends, the page ends.

