## Make it yours
- **Copy:** the headline, eyebrow, callout, paragraph and buttons are in `Hero.tsx`; the heading, lead and the four
  features in `Features.tsx`; the links in `Header.tsx`. Keep each heading to two short lines.
- **Brand:** swap `logo.svg` for your logo (around 110 × 20). Change `--blue` for your accent, `--ink` and `--bg` for
  text and page, `--hud` / `--hud-glow` for the scanner.
- **Portrait:** use your own face shot (4K or larger, so the zoom stays sharp) and set `IRIS` in `PortraitCanvas.tsx`
  to the centre and radius of the iris you want to zoom into, in the image's own pixels.
- **Product:** replace the four lens images with your own product's layers or parts: transparent, the same height,
  each centred in its file, so stacked they read as one object.
- **Pacing:** the unit table in M2 (`SCENE` in `App.tsx`) and the scene height (`400svh` = three screens of
  scrolling).
